id=ledfx_loopback
name=LedFx Loopback
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=Blade (YeonV)
description=Systemizes an already-installed LedFx as a privileged app so it can capture the full system audio mix (REMOTE_SUBMIX, "System Audio (root)") without a MediaProjection consent dialog and without app-level opt-outs. Requires LedFx already installed from the normal release channel. Self-heals across LedFx updates and reboots - see service.sh.
